OL,3,GNEWSAFormer Conservative MP joins
OL,4,AReform UK
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former Conservative MP has announced
OL,7,Fshe is joining Reform UK, saying she
OL,8,Fwants to pursue "more radical solutions
OL,9,Fto our country's problems".
OL,11,FJane Stevenson, who represented
OL,12,FWolverhampton North East for the
OL,13,FConservatives between 2019 and 2024,
OL,14,Fmade the announcement after Reform's
OL,15,Fconference in Birmingham.
OL,17,FShe said she had left the Conservatives
OL,18,Fseveral months ago after losing her
OL,19,Fseat to Labour's Sureena Brackenridge
OL,20,Fat the general election in 2024.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,360,350,200,160,0,100
